.if \n(.g .mso www.tmac
.TH lxc.conf 5 2026-08-01 "" ""
.SH "نام (NAME)"
lxc.conf \- Configuration files for LXC. 
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
LXC configuration is split in two parts. Container configuration
and system configuration.
.SS "CONTAINER CONFIGURATION"
The container configuration is held in the
\*(T<\fIconfig\fR\*(T> stored in the container's
directory.
.PP
A basic configuration is generated at container creation time
with the default's recommended for the chosen template as well
as extra default keys coming from the
\*(T<\fIdefault.conf\fR\*(T> file.
.PP
That \*(T<\fIdefault.conf\fR\*(T> file is either located
at \*(T<\fI/etc/lxc/default.conf\fR\*(T> or for
unprivileged containers at
\*(T<\fI~/.config/lxc/default.conf\fR\*(T>.
.PP
Details about the syntax of this file can be found in:
\fBlxc.container.conf\fR(5)
.SS "SYSTEM CONFIGURATION"
The system configuration is located at
\*(T<\fI/etc/lxc/lxc.conf\fR\*(T> or
\*(T<\fI~/.config/lxc/lxc.conf\fR\*(T> for unprivileged
containers.
.PP
This configuration file is used to set values such as default
lookup paths and storage backend settings for LXC.
.PP
Details about the syntax of this file can be found in:
\fBlxc.system.conf\fR(5)
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
\fBlxc\fR(1),
\fBlxc.container.conf\fR(5),
\fBlxc.system.conf\fR(5),
\fBlxc-usernet\fR(5)
